{"id":"scherzo","lemma":"scherzo","pos":"noun","rank":874,"glosses":["joke, jest, trick, hoax, frolic","joke, trifle, cinch (something easy to do)","scherzo (piece of music played in a playful manner)"],"ipa":"/ˈsker.t͡so/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"scherzi"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-scherzo.wav","examples":[{"text":"È uno scherzo?","en":"Is it a joke?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"a / one"},null]},{"text":"Spero che sia uno scherzo.","en":"I hope that's a joke.","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"sperare"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"both ... and .."},{"g":"a / one"},null]},{"text":"Era soltanto uno scherzo.","en":"It was only a joke.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"a / one"},null]},{"text":"Non è altro che uno scherzo.","en":"It is nothing but a joke.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null,null,{"g":"a / one"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"so much for"]]},{"text":"Non ha capito lo scherzo.","en":"He didn't get the joke.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"to understand","l":"capire"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}